<title>USA: Waste Recovery names Bernstein chairman.</title>
<headline>Waste Recovery names Bernstein chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waste Recovery Inc, the largest processor of waste tires in the U.S., Thursday said Martin Bernstein was elected chairman, a position that has been vacant since June of 1996.</p>
<p>Bernstein joined the board of WRI in December of 1996 in connection with WRI's acquisition of U.S. Tire LP, where he served as chairman.</p>
